{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4532456e-c350-8468-8dff-5ba5bb1c246d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:19:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi Denise. My name's Nancy Gifford. I'm calling for my mother, she's, um, she doesn't really do the phone thing. So there's water ponding at the curb in front of her place and it's been like that for days. It's not even raining. It's totally dry out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it coming from a drain, or is it just sitting along the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:17:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's just sitting there, like, it runs down and pools at the curb and the drain right there doesn't take it. It's meltwater or whatever it is, and then overnight it freezes. So every morning it's a sheet of black ice. Somebody is going to wipe out on it, I'm telling you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real hazard this time of year. Has anyone been out to look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nobody. And it's not just my mom. There's an older gentleman next door and he can't get out of the house when it's like that. He's stuck, basically. He won't even try the steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me get some details so I can put it in. What's the street and number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, I'd rather not say the address on this line, can you just take my number? It's 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, I really do need the location for the crew to find it, though. Without it I can only take a general note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so what can you do with a general note? Because I want to know, are you opening a work order, and for what date? Like, when is somebody actually coming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a date without a location. If you call back with the address, I'll open the order right then, and the crew supervisor sets the schedule. Icy spots usually get bumped up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, okay. That's, like, wicked annoying but fine. I'll call back with it. Sorry, I'm a little scattered, I just got beaten at checkers by a six year old."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:19:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that happens. Call me back and we'll get it going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks, Denise."
    }
  ],
